# Local IPOs: the game's building panel for a listed company's headquarters. Gold title bar with
# the company's coin, and a listing section above the Historical Building line: the offering in
# its first week (one Buy at the offering price), then the listing and the city's stake (Buy and
# Sell). The game's rows stay; with the company gone the panel is the game's own again.
# Everything listed is removed in cleanup; the 250 shares cost the test company's offering price.
name local ipos: the headquarters' building panel shows the listing, offering then trading
local-ipos on
ipo-healthy-days 1
ipo-scan
ipo-dialog on
ipo-list-now
wait 1
ipo-view
wait 1.5
expect-building-panel
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingGold
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingCoin
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingBadge OFFERING
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingLine First trading day
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingNote Offering price ·
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingStake The city can buy up to 1,000 shares (a 10% stake,
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingBuy Buy at the offering price
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulBuildingSell
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
# the game's workers block keeps its place above the section
expect-no-overlap ZoneTypeInfo FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing MakeHistoricalPanel
# a listed company's headquarters stays Historical: the tick is shown, not offered
expect-headquarters historical
expect-headquarters locked
capture building-panel-offering
ipo-buy 250
wait 1.5
# bought into the offering: Buy and Sell side by side, so the dialog is always one click away
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingBadge OFFERING
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingSell
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
capture building-panel-offering-held
ipo-first-day
wait 1.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingBadge TRADING
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingLine Listed
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingStake City holds 250 of 1,000 shares · avg
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingSell
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBuildingGain
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
capture building-panel-trading
# all the city may hold: Buy is greyed out, and a dialog opened on Buy turns to Sell (an empty
# share range would leave the game's slider thumb taking every click in the dialog)
ipo-buy 750
wait 1.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBuildingStake City holds 1,000 of 1,000 shares
ipo-open-buy
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
expect-log nothing left to buy, the dialog opens on Sell
close-dialog
wait 0.5
ipo-remove-test
wait 1.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulBuildingListing
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulBuildingGold
expect-visible MakeHistoricalPanel
cleanup:
close-dialog
ipo-dialog close
ipo-remove-test
local-ipos restore
